+### Why a saved wide-layout switch reads as a chat width level
+
+`chatWidth` replaced the `wideChatLayoutEnabled` boolean. The parser reads a document that still carries the old switch as `full-width` for `true` and `compact` for `false`, so an upgrade does not move anyone's layout. Keeping the boolean as a second field would have made every reader decide which of the two wins.
